    "title": "Apple TV+ Renews 'Stick' for Season 2",
    "text": "Trending Story\nUpdated 03:26 AM UTC, Thu July 24, 2025\nApple TV+ Renews 'Stick' for Season 2\nApple TV+ renewed the golf comedy \"Stick\" on Wednesday. Owen Wilson, Peter Dager, Marc Maron, Mariana Trevińo and Lilli Kay are confirmed to return in Season 2.\nOwen Wilson\n\"I think we all had a great time making it. It's really nice to see the show connecting with people and to know that we get a chance to continue the story!\"\nJason Keller\n\"I am inspired and humbled by the audience reaction to 'Stick,' and I’m thrilled to be making a second season with this magical cast, led by the incomparable Owen Wilson, and the wonderful creative team at Apple TV+. It’s a joy to be able to continue this story.\"\nMatt Cherniss\n\"There's plenty more in the bag for fans of the series, and we’re thrilled they’ll soon have the chance to discover Pryce Cahill’s next chapter.\"",
